WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.844
Hello everyone, welcome back to Nagarjuna.

00:00:03.844 --> 00:00:07.170
This is the tenth lesson of the venerated Nagarjuna.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.522
We will be discussing
BCINGS PA DANG THAR PA BRTAG PA

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:13.575
BCINGS PA DANG THAR PA BRTAG PA.

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:16.742
Repeat after us: BCINGS PA, DANG

00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:19.180
THAR PA, BRTAG PA.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.833
What is BRTAG PA?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.042
In Sanskrit, it
is

00:00:25.171 --> 00:00:28.020
PARĪKṢĀ (PARIKSHA).

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:32.690
Regarding BCINGS PA and THAR PA:

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.620
BCINGS PA means bondage,
like being chained in a prison.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.350
THAR PA means freedom.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.250
Now we will discuss the

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:46.250
emptiness of being bound in samsara,

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.960
and the emptiness of being free from those bondages. Let's

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.990
look at the first sentence, which is

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.383
actually only half a sentence. It

00:00:56.874 --> 00:00:58.945
begins with GAL TE. A

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:03.342
fellow man... Nagarjuna,

00:01:03.342 --> 00:01:06.584
is asking another person:

00:01:08.025 --> 00:01:10.650
"Who is in samsara?"

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:12.580
Who is in this cycle of samsara?

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:15.980
Who is going around in circles in samsara?

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.500
This is an interesting question.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.130
Incidentally, if you don't understand

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.405
who is going around in samsara,

00:01:24.405 --> 00:01:29.284
you will be going around in samsara yourself.

00:01:29.284 --> 00:01:31.030
So it's a pretty good question.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.796
GAL TE
'DU BYED 'KHOR ZHE NA,

00:01:34.796 --> 00:01:38.030
DE DAG RTAG NA MI 'KHOR TE,

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.436
GAL TE means that

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:42.620
Nagarjuna was talking to another person: "

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.060
Who is wandering in samsara?" The

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:48.670
other person said: 'DU BYED'.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:52.610
This is a confusing answer
because 'DU BYED' means cause and effect.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.100
In fact, it is also

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.850
the name of the second stage of the wheel of life, that is,

00:01:55.850 --> 00:01:58.390
karma.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:00.360
But that is completely unrelated to the meaning

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.692
here. Here it refers to PHUNG PO,

00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:04.942
body and mind.

00:02:04.942 --> 00:02:06.440
Lately I like to call it body and mind because it is easier to understand. It is exactly what we call body and mind.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.920


00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.450


00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:16.450
If you say that what is going around in samsara

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.260
is the combination of body and mind, both body and mind together

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.472
'KHOR ZHE NA',

00:02:22.472 --> 00:02:25.770


00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.000
then do you think of body and mind

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.840
as unchanging or changing?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.150
When you're asked, "Who travels through samsara? Who is reborn again and again?" and you answer "body and mind," specifically

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.730


00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.070


00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.380


00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:44.810
Michael's body and mind, I say, "Is it something unchanging,

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:48.510


00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.290
or something that changes?"

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:53.010
Nagarjuna usually gives both answers. The other person says it's unchanging, something that remains constant. Oh, if Michael's body and mind are unchanging, by the way, that leads to eternity, doesn't it?

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:56.700
Some people mistranslate this word.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.780


00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.912


00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:08.300


00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:13.600
It leads to eternity. If Michael's eternal body and mind are constantly traveling in the cycle of reincarnation, then it cannot go in circles. Why? Because it is RTAG PA, because it is unchanging, to go around in circles you must change. Through going around in circles you will change. Going around in circles means you will change. If you don't change, you can't go to other places. At least you have to change where you sit.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:16.410
Some things have to change when you travel. Therefore, it can't be

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:18.150


00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:22.280
Michael. Michael's unchanging body and mind

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:25.410


00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.084


00:03:27.084 --> 00:03:29.334


00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.320


00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.870
 
because it has to be reborn again and again. Then

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:36.380


00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.890


00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.770


00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:44.060
another person will come back and say: "Okay, then I'll

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.460
change my story. It's a body and

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.770


00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:53.070


00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:56.280
mind that change." Here is the

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.600


00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.200
next sentence.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.420
Yay~ By the way, the second half of

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:05.850


00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:09.450


00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:13.170
this verse has been split up again. The first part of the second half is MI RTAG NA YANG 'KHOR MI 'GYUR

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.410


00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:17.860


00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.893
MI RTAG NA YANG 'KHOR MI 'GYUR If you say that Michael's body and mind change, then they can't go around in the cycle of rebirth. Why?

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:23.700


00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.700
Because they disappear every thousandth of a second, understand?

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:33.580
They can maintain... SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS ... The definition of change SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS Repeat SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS This could be a good song SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS... It means things that appear and

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.413


00:04:34.413 --> 00:04:38.840
disappear SKAD CIG every moment SKAD CIG GIS SKAD CIG GIS How can it go on forever? If it disappears every thousandth of a second, how can something that

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.415


00:04:41.415 --> 00:04:42.990


00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.216


00:04:46.216 --> 00:04:47.368


00:04:47.368 --> 00:04:49.208


00:04:50.437 --> 00:04:52.669


00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:59.910
 


00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.210
disappears every thousandth of a second go around in circles? It's impossible. Why? Because

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.826


00:05:03.826 --> 00:05:07.184
every thousandth of a second of Michael's mind and body is separate from the previous thousandth of a second of Michael's mind and body, right? We have spent a long time explaining SAṂSARGA (SANSARGA) Christina,

00:05:07.184 --> 00:05:09.975
SANSARGA

00:05:11.308 --> 00:05:15.266
flows together. Yes,

00:05:15.266 --> 00:05:18.530
if Geshe-la's mind and body are like tap, tap, tap, tap, then

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:21.090
each moment is separate. Then there is

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.500


00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.970
no reason

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:27.380
why this should go to that, because they never touch. So this can also become Tim's mind and body,

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:32.380


00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:37.230


00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.090
right? Since they are not connected anyway, if Michael

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.670


00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:43.660


00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.763


00:05:45.763 --> 00:05:47.192


00:05:47.192 --> 00:05:51.908
's mind and body are like this, why can't Michael's mind and body be like this and then become Tim in the

00:05:51.908 --> 00:05:54.260


00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:57.450
next moment? Why not?

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.670
There's no reason

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.220
 
why I can't

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:05.850
become Tim. Tim and Geshe-sensei aren't connected either. If there's no connection between Geshe-sensei and Geshe-sensei, but Geshe-sensei can move from one moment to the next like this, then Geshe-sensei's body and mind can also become Tim's body and mind. Then I can go there and join Tim's cycle of reincarnation,

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.350
right? Do

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.463


00:06:10.463 --> 00:06:13.863


00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:19.390


00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.870
you understand? If they are separate, anything can happen,

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.200
but it

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:28.030
cannot be connected. It cannot be a continuous stream. Why? Because it will remain unchanged, then you will

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:30.297
not have different births,

00:06:30.297 --> 00:06:33.383
and you will always be stuck in the same moment, just like... what is the name of that movie? "Temporarily suspended today." Yes, "Temporarily suspended today." Okay, next sentence.

00:06:33.383 --> 00:06:35.390


00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:37.290


00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.107
Where? We should have a picture,

00:06:41.107 --> 00:06:43.080
right? Let's talk about circles. I think it should be seconds. Lama Qiuni said:

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:46.060
If Geshe's mind and body can only last for

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.290


00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:50.260
one-thousandth of a second,

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.093
how can he have time to circle?

00:06:51.093 --> 00:06:52.720


00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.370
You can't form a

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.770
circle with just one point. You can't draw a circle with just one point.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:59.985


00:06:59.985 --> 00:07:03.636
 


00:07:03.636 --> 00:07:06.403
Okay, next sentence: SEMS CAN LA YANG RIM 'DI MTSUNGS SEMS CAN LA YANG RIM 'DI MTSUNGS SEMS CAN means living beings. You can also say sentient beings. I don't like this word because it's not really English. You wouldn't usually say it like that

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.620
in English.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.837


00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.970


00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:20.810


00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:25.810


00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.870


00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.950
How is your sentient being mother? Anyway, it refers to biological

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.850


00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.820


00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.980


00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.403


00:07:44.693 --> 00:07:48.151
SEMS CAN LA YANG, RIM RIM. What does it mean? Like Lam Rim (steps),

00:07:48.151 --> 00:07:50.818
in Nagarjuna Rim,

00:07:51.923 --> 00:07:55.140
Rim has a special meaning. It means the steps leading to the argument I just gave you. Those steps that lead to the final argument are called Rim (steps) in Nagarjuna's words. When you see Nagarjuna mention Rim,

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:56.560
you should think: the steps leading to my final argument.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:59.800


00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:02.030


00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:06.090


00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:09.514


00:08:09.514 --> 00:08:13.949
 
What does that mean here? If you say that what is circling in

00:08:13.949 --> 00:08:15.090


00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:20.090
the wheel of life is not Geshe-la's mind and body, but Geshe-la himself, then that is RIM MTSUNGS, the same

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:24.763
argument, returning to the same argument, what is that? What was the

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:29.060
first question Nagarjuna asked? Don't forget we've already discussed body and mind. Now that person says, "Okay, body and mind can't go in circles, so it must be Geshe-la-shi who's going in circles." Alright, let's do the same argument. We

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.820


00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.060
asked him two questions: If

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.000


00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.310


00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:43.080
you say Geshe-la-shi is going in circles in samsara,

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.570


00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.710


00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:52.710


00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.960
then is the Geshe-la-shi you're talking about unchanging? He started by talking about what is unchanging, but I don't

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.510


00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:00.160


00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.860
know why you're talking about the unchanging Geshe teacher?

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:07.250
Yes, yes, I'm talking about the unchanging

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.650
Geshe teacher. How could he possibly go in circles? Because he's always at the same point. He's the same person. He won't become an animal, a celestial being, or a being from hell. He will always be the

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.550


00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.470


00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:19.330
Geshe teacher. He can't

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:23.840
change. So what is the second RIM PA? Or are

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.440


00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.690
you saying that Geshe-la (Geshe teacher) is subject to change? So he is the various random moments of

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.190
Geshe-la-shi. In that case, we have already proved with the contact argument that there is not

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.830
necessarily a connection between Geshe-la-shi's first

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:33.663
moment and Geshe-la-shi's second moment. Geshe-la-shi's first

00:09:33.663 --> 00:09:35.690


00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:38.940


00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.570


00:09:40.570 --> 00:09:43.360


00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.387


00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.110


00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.100


00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:53.920
moment can become Tim's second moment. So who is going around in circles? Therefore, no one is in the cycle of reincarnation, no one travels through the wheel of life. Why? Because it is neither Geshe-la-shi's mind and body nor

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.640


00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.380


00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:02.690
 


00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.100
Geshe-la-shi, why? Because it's neither a Geshe teacher with a body and mind that can change and remain unchanged, nor a Geshe teacher with a body and mind that

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.330
can change and remain unchanged, then there's nothing else.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.260


00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:14.011
No one is

00:10:14.011 --> 00:10:16.740
going around in circles in the cycle of reincarnation.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:17.573


00:10:17.573 --> 00:10:19.400


00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.010
Okay, we have a picture. By the way, there's a concept that Lama Chuni likes to talk about... He said, don't forget,

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.390
when we mention Geshe teachers,

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.570
relative to the body and mind of a

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:24.953
Geshe teacher, we're talking about something like a soul

00:10:24.953 --> 00:10:29.810
 


00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.380


00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:36.697
. Is there a huge Geshe teacher who keeps

00:10:36.697 --> 00:10:40.340


00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.980


00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:47.270


00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:50.810


00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.690
reincarnating again and again? He doesn't look like a Geshe teacher; it's unrelated to body and mind.

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.430


00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:58.417


00:10:58.417 --> 00:11:03.417
There's some kind of inner soul or essence of a Geshe teacher who acquires different bodies and minds, right? He will

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:07.040


00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.750
discard the old body and mind

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.000
and acquire a new body and mind.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.100
Therefore, there is a Geshe teacher who is unrelated to the Geshe teacher's body and mind. The

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.570


00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:19.210
Geshe teacher has this third part, which is the

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.500
"super inner Geshe teacher".

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:26.320
And the inner Geshe teacher will continuously change his body and mind.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:29.338
This is the second argument, which

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.555
I will talk about.

00:11:32.555 --> 00:11:34.180
In fact, that is what the whole chapter is about. Don't cheat yet, let's continue. That is

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.920


00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:38.730
actually the focus of the whole chapter.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.670
Good question.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.986
Let's continue.

00:11:43.661 --> 00:11:45.452
The next sentence is

00:11:49.117 --> 00:11:50.858
GAL TE GANG ZAG 'KHOR ZHE NA,

00:11:50.858 --> 00:11:53.299
PHUNG PO SKYE MCHED KHAMS RNAMS LA,

00:11:53.299 --> 00:11:56.140
DE NI RNAM PA LNGAS BTZAL NA,

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:59.600
MED NA GANG ZHIG 'KHOR BAR 'GYUR.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.770
This part has two sentences, and this is the first sentence. GAL TE GANG ZAG

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.640
'KHOR ZHE NA.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:05.960
That person insists,

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.230
no, that is the Geshe teacher.

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:11.496
That GANG ZAG, PURUSHA

00:12:11.496 --> 00:12:14.680
is the Geshe teacher from one life to the next.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:19.680
He discards the old body and mind and acquires a new body and mind. Just like

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.990
some high school boys treat their girlfriends,

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.850
or some high school girls treat their boyfriends, he abandons one body and mind and takes another, and then changes to yet

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.200


00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.610
another,

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.550
but he continues to attend high school.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:36.550
That person said that it is indeed Geshe-laoshi constantly being reborn.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:40.640


00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:44.300
So let's examine the

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.850
relationship between Geshe-laoshi and his body and mind.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:50.850
If it is indeed Geshe-laoshi constantly

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:54.660
abandoning his body and mind

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:56.390
and taking on a new one, then what is the relationship between Geshe-laoshi and his body and mind

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.810


00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:00.790
?

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.470
Because of certain relationships between him and his body and mind,

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.550
he cannot

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.980
change his body and mind. If Geshe-la is his body and mind, then he cannot abandon his body and mind to be

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.560


00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.590


00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.263
reborn into the next life
because he will disappear.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:20.330
If Geshe-la is his body and mind,

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:23.090
once he abandons his body and mind to obtain the next body and mind, Geshe-la is

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.510
no longer the same body and mind as before.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.170
He must be some kind of

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.580
superhuman who can change his body and mind, right?

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:33.590
So what exactly is their relationship?
Nagarjuna said: Okay, okay.

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:34.670
Geshe-sensei will continue, right? Is it possible for Geshe teachers to have their bodies and minds replaced? So, it couldn't be

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:35.837


00:13:35.837 --> 00:13:37.380
Geshe-laoshi's mind and body, right?

00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.213


00:13:38.213 --> 00:13:40.780
 


00:13:40.780 --> 00:13:41.613
Why?

00:13:41.613 --> 00:13:44.010
Because he will abandon his body and mind and go somewhere else. If he only has his body and mind and he abandons his body and mind, then

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.643


00:13:46.643 --> 00:13:49.016
he will disappear. Do you

00:13:49.016 --> 00:13:49.849
understand?

00:13:49.849 --> 00:13:51.787
There is no Geshe teacher who can change body and mind,

00:13:51.787 --> 00:13:53.740
because he is his body and mind.

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:56.280
We should look at the

